    T19
        title       Persistence edge, write-ahead and the driver
        status      draft
        priority    high
        blocked_by  [@T18, @task.V3.T10]
        description
            Build the persistence edge, write-ahead and the Effect driver in `src/host/` from @spec.WriteAhead.

            **Why now:** the core returns work as data; nothing runs it or writes records yet, so durability
            cannot be judged.

            **Read first:** @spec.WriteAhead, @spec.WriteAhead.I15 (which took the cut I16), @spec.WriteAhead.I17,
            code:packages/flow-state-v3/conformance/README.md ("Planned Port changes": the disk reader).

            - **May change:** `src/`.
            - **Evidence:** this Task's comments.
            - **False pass:** durability judged from the runtime's report → caught by the disk
              reader.
            - **Gates:** the suite; falsify.
            - **Stops:** a guarantee change.
        acceptance
            The WriteAhead area passes on production.
    T20
        title       Restore and key versions
        status      draft
        priority    high
        blocked_by  [@T19, @task.V3.T11]
        description
            Build restore and key versions from @spec.Restore and @spec.Codec, with record formats tagged from
